{"about_the_game":"An adventurer lost in the crypt of the ancient Egyptian pyramids. He needs to go through many dungeons to get to the surface. <br />\r\nDo you have multi levels , nice chalk graphics, classic gameplay in the spirit of the old games. <br />\r\nThe game has a built in level editor. You can create your crypts to pass.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLogical puzzle game in which the player moves the platform in the maze. You must move the platform to the desired end position. Only one platform can be moved at a time. The hero of the game - &quot;the adventurer&quot; - can only push crates but not pull them. Help brave pass all the tests.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/732070?t=1510337954","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732070/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1510337954","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732070/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1510337954","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/732070/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1510337954","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"An adventurer lost in the crypt of the ancient Egyptian pyramids. He needs to go through many dungeons to get to the surface. <br />\r\nDo you have multi levels , nice chalk graphics, classic gameplay in the spirit of the old games. <br />\r\nThe game has a built in level editor. You can create your crypts to pass.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLogical puzzle game in which the player moves the platform in the maze. You must move the platform to the desired end position. Only one platform can be moved at a time. The hero of the game - &quot;the adventurer&quot; - can only push crates but not pull them. Help brave pass all the tests.","developers":["Sokolab"],"genres"